 "title": "NASA's New Space Telescope",
 "cat": "space",
 "emoji": "🔭",
 "sentences": [
  "Meet NASA's brand new space telescope concept!",
  "It is called the PRobe far-Infrared Mission for Astrophysics, or PRIMA.",
  "Selected in September 2026, it leads a brand new class of Probe Explorers.",
  "By observing far-infrared light, it cuts right through cosmic dust.",
  "This helps scientists study the formation of planets, stars, and black holes.",
  "It could even reveal how water on Earth came to be.",
  "If confirmed, it targets a 2033 launch for a 5-year mission."
